ed units gain bonus movement speed and armor.\n\nAxe permanently drenches his blade every time he kills an enemy Hero with Culling Blade, gaining bonus armor for each stack.", "notes_zh": ["淘汰之刃的斩杀效果无法被薄葬等技能阻止。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "speed_bonus", "armor_bonus", "speed_duration", "speed_aoe", "charge_speed", "armor_per_stack", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "axe_one_man_army", "name_zh": "斧王·一人之军", "name_en": "One Man Army", "description_zh": "只要斧王附近%radius%范围内没有友方英雄，他就会获得%armor_pct_as_strength%%%自身护甲值的力量加成。这个效果在接近一名友军后会在%bonus_linger_duration%秒内消失。", "description_en": "Axe gains Strength based on %armor_pct_as_strength%%% of his Armor as long as there are no allied heroes within %radius% distance from Axe.  The effect fades over %bonus_linger_duration%s after approaching an ally.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["armor_pct_as_strength", "current_max_str_bonus", "radius", "bonus_linger_duration"]}, {"subject": "bane_enfeeble", "name_zh": "祸乱之源·虚弱", "name_en": "Enfeeble", "description_zh": "每秒造成伤害，并且降低敌人的总攻击力和施法距离。", "description_en": "Deals damage every second and lowers the enemy's total attack damage and cast range.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_reduction", "cast_reduction", "duration", "enfeeble_tick_damage", "damage_tick_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "bane_brain_sap", "name_zh": "祸乱之源·蚀脑", "name_en": "Brain Sap", "description_zh": "暴食一个敌方单位的生命能量，造成伤害并回复自身生命值。", "description_en": "Feasts on the vital energies of an enemy unit, healing Bane and dealing damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "减少%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒冷却时间。蚀脑变成%shard_radius%作用范围的技能。次级目标只有%shard_secondary_target_heal_pct%%%治疗效果。", "en": "Reduces cooldown by 